      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling that your foundation is gone is terrifying, but it is not the same as your mind being deleted or your identity erased. Even when the \"me\" feels like it is evaporating, the person who is still here is capable of feeling this pain and seeking safety. You do not have to fix the house while the ground is gone; you can simply find a place to rest until the ground is ready to support you again. Please reach out to a professional who can help you rebuild a sense of self, even if it feels impossible right now.",
